<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-JULY PPI ROSE 0.9 PCT MO/MO, 5.6 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-JULY PPI ROSE 0.9 PCT MO/MO, 5.6 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's producer price index</p>
<p>rose 0.9 percent month-on-month in July and 5.6 percent</p>
<p>year-on-year, the statistics department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    LITHUANIAN PPI		  July 97  June 97  July 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct)  +0.9     -0.2     +2.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    +5.6     +6.7     +19.8</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
